WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.010
Do your customers want to write a Google review…

00:00:03.310 --> 00:00:05.360
but stop because they don’t know what to write?

00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:09.520
Reviyo helps them put their experience into words.

00:00:09.990 --> 00:00:14.240
Place your Reviyo QR at the counter, on a table or on a bill.

00:00:14.640 --> 00:00:19.250
Customers scan with their phone camera to open your business’s review page.

00:00:19.660 --> 00:00:21.290
No app download is needed.

00:00:21.660 --> 00:00:23.340
No customer account is needed either.

00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:27.820
They choose topics about their experience and add a few words.

00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:33.410
With their consent, Reviyo AI uses those details to prepare a review draft.

00:00:33.830 --> 00:00:35.560
Customers can read the draft.

00:00:35.910 --> 00:00:37.900
They can correct anything that isn’t right.

00:00:38.230 --> 00:00:40.650
They can make it sound like themselves.

00:00:41.090 --> 00:00:42.890
The opinion always stays theirs.

00:00:43.330 --> 00:00:47.090
Then they copy the text and open your Google review page.

00:00:47.500 --> 00:00:51.770
They choose their stars and post from their own Google account.

00:00:52.170 --> 00:00:54.940
Reviyo never automatically posts on their behalf.

00:00:55.360 --> 00:00:59.410
As the owner, customise your topics and print your QR card.

00:00:59.840 --> 00:01:03.990
See where scans come from and where customers stop in the journey.

00:01:04.400 --> 00:01:06.930
Give every customer the same opportunity to review.

00:01:07.320 --> 00:01:08.920
Never offer rewards for reviews.

00:01:09.360 --> 00:01:13.030
Start with a free Google review QR code for your business.

00:01:13.420 --> 00:01:15.580
Learn more at reviyo.in.
